OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786344474
OL,3,CSouth East Water CEO apologises
OL,4,Cfollowing weekend outages in Kent and
OL,5,CSussex
OL,7,FSouth East Water's new Chief Executive
OL,8,Fsays he is sorry to customers after
OL,9,Fthousands were affected by supply
OL,10,Fissues in Kent and Sussex.
OL,12,FIn a video from a bottled water
OL,13,Fstation on Saturday, John Halsall, who
OL,14,Fhas been in the job for weeks, said
OL,15,Fhis teams were working as fast as
OL,16,Fhumanely possible to fix the system.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
