OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786344474
OL,3,CSouth East Water CEO apologises
OL,4,Cfollowing weekend outages in Kent and
OL,5,CSussex
OL,7,FTaps were switched off so critical
OL,8,Fmaintenance works to fix electrical
OL,9,Ffaults could be carried out at a water
OL,10,Ftreatment works which supplied
OL,11,Fhouseholds and businesses in and
OL,12,Faround Sittingbourne.
OL,14,FBy Sunday morning water was beginning
OL,15,Fto flow out of taps but bottled water
OL,16,Fstations were reopened, with supply
OL,17,Fissues impacting distribution on
OL,18,FSaturday night.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
