OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786344474
OL,3,CSouth East Water CEO apologises
OL,4,Cfollowing weekend outages in Kent and
OL,5,CSussex
OL,7,FThe company said, "Water has returned
OL,8,Fovernight to customers in Bredgar,
OL,9,FBorden, Doddington and surrounding
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,12,F"Supplies are gradually being restored
OL,13,Fto the remaining customers in Teynham,
OL,14,FLenham, Otterden, Pluckley and Egerton
OL,15,Ftoday.
OL,17,F"It takes time for water to flow
OL,18,Fthrough the vast network of pipes
OL,19,Fwhich have been affected. We also need
OL,20,Fto do this carefully to avoid burst
OL,21,Fwater mains."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
