OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786344474
OL,3,CSouth East Water CEO apologises
OL,4,Cfollowing weekend outages in Kent and
OL,5,CSussex
OL,7,FFor the second weekend in a row, a
OL,8,Fburst pipe caused yet more misery for
OL,9,Fpeople living in Tonbridge.
OL,11,F3,500 customers were impacted by the
OL,12,Fruptured main with repairs carried out
OL,13,Fand supplies returned by Saturday
OL,14,Fnight.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
